            {
              "answer": "m",
              "why": "*Şapkam* is **my** hat; *senin* calls for *şapkan*."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "explain": "*Şapka* ends in a vowel, so **your** is just *-n*: *senin şapkan*."
